  "name": "Courgette and Broad Bean Risotto with Basil Pesto",
  "subtitle": "Creamy summer risotto with herb pesto",
  "description": "A bright risotto combining diced courgettes, broad beans, lemon, herbs, and a nutty basil pesto.",
